    "767 keys per engine: the 728 declarations the pinned `lib` promises, 15",
    "behavioural cases from the real esbuild+Babel pipeline, and 24 deliberate",
    "out-of-pin checks. Both engines are the same Rhino build",
    "(java/Packages/JavaImporter present, Nashorn's Java absent) but they are",
    "NOT identical: PingIDM carries Symbol.toStringTag on Math and JSON and",
    "PingAM does not. Each program is checked against its own engine.",
    "Re-measure with `fo doctor --engines --record`, which needs a running",
    "stack. It generates its probe list FROM these keys, so this file cannot",
    "discover a builtin nobody added - that is why the required set is derived",
    "independently by tools/engine-coverage.mjs and a key it names but this",
    "file lacks is a test failure. Do not hand-edit the values.",
    "`fo build` fails on any USE of a key recorded false that it can resolve",
    "statically, before it emits; tools/engine-usage.mjs states which forms",
    "those are.",
    "The original spike and the traps it hit: spike/ENGINE-SURFACE.md.",
